      "side": 1,
      "message": "The odds of us changing uapi .h files is _very_ low, I don\u0027t think we have ever done that before, which would require this type of change in the past.  So putting __kernel__ in android_kapi.h wouldn\u0027t seem like it really matters much.\n\nNote, that will also probably not work as linux/android_kabi.h would not be able to be found when the uapi .h files are exported in the userspace package.  They need to be self-contained, so this would require android-kabi.h to also be added to them, making that part of the uapi files?",
