      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003eThere are an awful lot of #include \u003clinux/iio/types.h\u003e so adding the macro after each one isn\u0027t really a good idea.\n\nNot sure what you mean by this. Could you rephrase please?\n\n\u003e You could change from ln to sed in tools/iio/Makefile.\n\nWould that only fix the issue for tools/iio?\n\nIf any other userspace tool wants to use the header it will be broken.",
